{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11106290","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11106290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1110629001:0":{"text":"夢を見てるみたい……ソーン、僕をつねって！","source_cn":"真像做梦一样啊……索恩，你掐我一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B4732A139CC2996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110629002:0":{"text":"断る、早く行くぞ。決戦に遅刻して不戦敗になんてなったら……","source_cn":"不要，快走了。不然因为赶不上决战而失败——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BEA930AA5B901E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110629003:0":{"text":"縁起でもないこと言わないでよ！本当にそうなったら、夢の中で父ちゃんに叱られちゃう！行こっ！","source_cn":"啊啊！别说了，要是出了这种事，梦里的老爹一定会罚我的！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB58C276BD1DE593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"アルサ","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"ソーン","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}